{"4627600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dread Rally", "steam_appid": 4627600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow the crowd with flips, drifts, and vehicular carnage in Dread Rally, an arcade racing game where your life is in the audience’s hands. Welcome to Dread Rally, a 3D arcade racing game where you must outlast 11 other racers in order to become the people’s champion! While racing you must entertain the audience with fancy flip tricks and the destruction of your opponents all while trying to go as fast as possible. Select your vehicle from 3 factions: Brute Corp, Esotechnica, and A-Star. Play solo or with a friend in couch co-op through 4 tracks set on Mars during the aftermath of a corporate war between rival industries.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow the crowd with flips, drifts, and vehicular carnage in Dread Rally, an arcade racing game where your life is in the audience’s hands. Welcome to Dread Rally, a 3D arcade racing game where you must outlast 11 other racers in order to become the people’s champion! While racing you must entertain the audience with fancy flip tricks and the destruction of your opponents all while trying to go as fast as possible. Select your vehicle from 3 factions: Brute Corp, Esotechnica, and A-Star. Play solo or with a friend in couch co-op through 4 tracks set on Mars during the aftermath of a corporate war between rival industries.</p>", "short_description": "Wow the crowd with flips, drifts, and vehicular carnage in Dread Rally, an arcade racing game where your life is in the audience’s hands", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627600/70f0c30dc0aa88ef9ab5872b6435bb52ff153dcc/header.jpg?t=1779415669", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as